{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"X\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S03→S04：S03已经想告诉对方自己多喜欢这份亲近，还想确认对方是否也有同样感受；S04又回到几乎相同的表达和确认愿望，主要是把原来的念头放大，新增推进有限。\",\n    \"S11→S12→S13→S14：S11决定不再隐藏喜欢，S12进一步彻底放开自己去喜欢；S13却又退回想藏起心意、寻求不变保证的状态，S14再重新决定不隐藏。坦露与退缩之间有明显回摆。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S03→S04：也有想表达喜欢却没说出口、随后再次想表达的重复。不过S03侧重告诉对方自己喜欢这份亲近，S04进一步发展为完整坦白以及对对方反应的顾虑，推进相对明确。\",\n    \"S11→S12→S13→S14：同样经历不隐藏、想要保证并考虑少表达、最后重新选择坦露的摆动。但S13增加了一个新问题：即使听到对方保证，未来真的就能一直不变吗？因此不是简单退回最初的不安，而是对确定性的追问。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条整体发展基本一致，但X在S03提前提出了S04再次出现的相互确认愿望，重复感更强；S13也更像重新回到最初害怕暴露心意的状态。Y则在S13进一步质疑保证本身能否消除未来的不确定性，让回摆带有新的认识。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "573b3048-91ed-430d-bbe6-c40d9df30733", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T093100338671Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:31:24.139488+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "62603cf9718d6dc648242ac51d576bd6de0352b92dfa5c4899f31ccc80dbac99", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba